Please Take a Sit~

[en.FOCUS_C01_C04_INVITATION_desc]
“Hey, did you hear? Last time, a dude led an army to that whatever burg you mentioned. Guess what? He didn’t get it! His colleagues laughed at him for three weeks!”\n§g“And then?”§!\n“I heard he went to get the Empress’s signature! He’s going there again these days.”\n§g“Stratusburg, what a big deal! It even needs the Empress to handle its affairs.”§!

[zh.FOCUS_C01_C04_INVITATION]
请坐~

[zh.FOCUS_C01_C04_INVITATION_desc]
“诶你听说了吗，上次有个家伙带着军队上你说的那个什么什么堡去了。你猜怎么着？没拿下！被同事们笑话了三个周呢！”\n§g“后来呢？”§!\n“听说他去拿了女皇的亲笔签名！这两天又要过去。”\n§g“层云堡，出息了啊！居然得让女皇亲自处理了。”§!

